		{"id":"c303f3cff994766c","x":60,"y":-332,"width":647,"height":162,"type":"text","text":"After the fall, you feel like you are in a completely different place, the air around you feels warmer, more welcoming. \nYou look upwards and the rupture where you fell from is no longer there.\nIn front of you lays a wooden door with some light coming from the small gaps between the frame"},
